From f6792224bd354f889114f4e9883205dd86e8f28d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Italo Armenti <italo.armenti@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:08:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] glTF: reject external URIs that leave the asset directory

External buffer and image URIs were joined to the asset directory and
opened unchanged. Reject absolute paths and ".." segments, and refuse
external files when the asset is loaded from memory. Safe relative
paths are still resolved against the model directory.
